```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[User] -->|Registers via email/password & NIC| B(Application Identity)
    B -->|Status: PENDING| C{Admin Review}
    C -->|Rejects| D[Rejected Status]
    C -->|Approves| E[Status: APPROVED]
    
    E -->|Logs in & Connects MetaMask| F(Wallet Linking)
    F -->|Signs Cryptographic Nonce| G{Signature Verify}
    G -->|Fails| H[Linking Rejected]
    G -->|Passes| I[Wallet Verified & Associated]
    
    I -->|Admin Authorizes| J[Eligible Voter on Smart Contract]
    J -->|Submits Transaction| K(Smart Contract)
    K -->|Records Immutable Vote| L[(Blockchain)]
```
